       "data": "Out[230]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{[t₁(3/10), t₃(−7/10)] = 0 (companion, exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{[t₁(3/10), t₂(−7/10)] = 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{[t₂(9/20), t₃(−7/10)] = 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
