  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results.** Commutators vanish (f64: 1.7·10⁻¹⁶, 3.3·10⁻¹⁶, 8·10⁻¹⁷). The fused t₂, t₃ agree with the quantum-minor definition (f64: 4·10⁻¹⁶, 4·10⁻¹⁵; exact in `dual-lax-t3.wb`), t₄ is a scalar, t₄(u) = det G ∏_A(u−θ+h)(u−θ−h)(u−θ−2h)(u−θ−3h) ∏_F(u−θ)(u−θ−h)(u−θ−2h)(u−θ−4h) [50d, = z₁V₁(u)z₂V₂(u−h)z₃V₃(u−2h)z₄V₄(u−3h) on the vacuum].",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Calibration checks (task statement)\n\n(i) ⟨Ω|t₁(θ₁)⁻¹ = c₁⟨Ω|ρ₁(G^{−T}), c₁ = 1/(hθ₁₂(θ₁₃+h)θ₁₄), tested as ⟨Ω| = c₁⟨Ω|ρ₁(G^{−T}) t₁(θ₁). (ii) v_w⊗u_w⊗v_w⊗u_w eigenbra of t₁^{G_c(w)}. (iii) u_w G_c(z) v_w. Plus the frame map.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sqC1 = 1/(sqH (sqTh[[1]] - sqTh[[2]]) (sqTh[[1]] - sqTh[[3]] + sqH) (sqTh[[1]] - sqTh[[4]]));\nsqGmT = Transpose[Inverse[sqGcomp]];\nsqProd4[v1_, v2_, v3_, v4_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, v1, v2, v3, v4]];\n(* (i): bra action of rho_1(g) on site 1 is v -> v.g *)\nsqCalI[{v1_, v2_, v3_, v4_}] := sqProd4[v1, v2, v3, v4] == Normal[sqC1 sqProd4[v1 . sqGmT, v2, v3, v4] . sqTc[1, sqTh[[1]]]];\nsqVb = {1, 2/3, -1/5, 3}; sqRb = {2, -1, 1/7, 1/2}; sqWb = sqRb - (sqVb . sqRb)/(sqVb . sqVb) sqVb;\nsqWt = {7/5, 9/8, 3/7, 5/9};\nsqVw = Table[sqWt[[j]]^(4 - i), {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\nsqvw = {sqWt[[1]]^3, sqWt[[1]]^2, sqWt[[1]], 1}; squw = Inverse[sqVw][[4]];\nsqEvW[u_] := sqWt[[1]] (u - sqTh[[1]] + sqH) (u - sqTh[[2]]) (u - sqTh[[3]] + sqH) (u - sqTh[[4]]) + (sqWt[[2]] + sqWt[[3]]) (Times @@ (u - sqTh)) + sqWt[[4]] (u - sqTh[[1]]) (u - sqTh[[2]] - sqH) (u - sqTh[[3]]) (u - sqTh[[4]] - sqH);\nsqBraW = sqProd4[sqvw, squw, sqvw, squw];\nsqV = Table[sqZ[[j]]^(4 - i), {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\nsqR = KroneckerProduct[Transpose[Inverse[sqV]], sqV, Transpose[Inverse[sqV]], sqV];\nGrid[{\n  {\"c₁ = 603680/25947\", sqC1 == 603680/25947},\n  {\"(i) vacuum e₁⊗e₄⊗e₁⊗e₄\", sqCalI[{UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4]}]},\n  {\"(i) BPS v⊗w⊗v⊗w, v·w = 0\", sqCalI[{sqVb, sqWb, sqVb, sqWb}]},\n  {\"(i) generic NON-BPS product state\", sqCalI[{sqVb, sqRb, {-3, 1, 4/9, 1}, {1/3, 5, -2, 1}}]},\n  {\"(ii) twisted-vacuum eigenbra of t₁^{G_c(w)}(u), u = 3/10, −7/13\", And @@ Table[Normal[sqBraW . sqTransfer[sqLax1, u, sqGc[sqWt], 4]] == sqEvW[u] sqBraW, {u, {3/10, -7/13}}]},\n  {\"(iii) u_w G_c(z) v_w = 232551/1558000\", squw . sqGcomp . sqvw == 232551/1558000},\n  {\"frame map t^{G_c}(u) R = R t^Λ(u), a = 1, 2, 3, two u\", And @@ Flatten[Table[sqZeroQ[sqTc[a, u] . sqR - sqR . sqTd[a, u]], {a, 3}, {u, {3/10, -1/3}}]]}},\n Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"249\" data-out-n=\"243\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[243]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c₁ = 603680/25947</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i) vacuum e₁</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e₄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e₁</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e₄</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i) BPS v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">w, v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">w = 0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i) generic NON-BPS product state</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(ii) twisted-vacuum eigenbra of t₁</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">{G_c(w)}(u), u = 3/10, −7/13</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(iii) u_w G_c(z) v_w = 232551/1558000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frame map t</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">{G_c}(u) R = R t</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ(u), a = 1, 2, 3, two u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
