  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python result [exact].** Rank 256 (rank modulo the prime 2147483629 = 256, hence rank over ℚ = 256), as in `sov-companion-L4.wb`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Joint eigenstates and eigenvalue polynomials\n\nt^Λ conserves the Cartan weight μ (A site +e_i, F site −e_j; vacuum μ = (2,0,0,−2)), so the eigenproblem splits into 55 weight blocks (sizes 1 ×12, 2 ×24, 4 ×6, 12 ×12, 28 ×1). A generic combination t₁(3/11) + (7/10)t̄₃(−5/7) − (3/13)t̄₂(2/9) is diagonalised per block at 60 digits; τ̄_a (degree 4) by interpolation at 5 points; companion-frame kets |Ψ_c⟩ = R|Ψ_d⟩ (same eigenvalues).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sqBasis = Tuples[Range[4], 4];\nsqWeight[idx_] := Table[Count[idx[[{1, 3}]], i] - Count[idx[[{2, 4}]], i], {i, 4}];\nsqBlocks = Values[GroupBy[Range[256], sqWeight[sqBasis[[#]]] &]];\nsqUpts = Table[k/3 + 1/17, {k, -2, 2}];\nsqVand = Table[u^j, {u, sqUpts}, {j, 0, 4}];\nsqComb = sqTd[1, 3/11] + 7/10 sqTdBar[3, -5/7] - 3/13 sqTdBar[2, 2/9];\nsqHorner[c_, u_] := Fold[#1 u + #2 &, 0, Reverse[c]];\nsqStates = Flatten[Table[Module[{vecs, mats, evs},\n     {evs, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[Normal[sqComb[[blk, blk]]], 60]];\n     mats = Table[Normal[sqTdBar[a, u][[blk, blk]]], {a, 3}, {u, sqUpts}];\n     Table[Module[{v = vecs[[k]], p, lam},\n       p = Ordering[Abs[v], -1][[1]]; v = v/v[[p]];\n       lam = Table[(mats[[a, m]] . v)[[p]], {a, 3}, {m, 5}];\n       <|\"blk\" -> blk, \"weight\" -> sqWeight[sqBasis[[blk[[1]]]]], \"vec\" -> v, \"comb\" -> evs[[k]],\n        \"taubar\" -> Table[LinearSolve[sqVand, lam[[a]]], {a, 3}],\n        \"res\" -> Max[Table[Norm[mats[[a, m]] . v - lam[[a, m]] v], {a, 3}, {m, 5}]]|>], {k, Length[blk]}]],\n    {blk, sqBlocks}], 1];\nsqTau[st_, 0, u_] := 1;\nsqTau[st_, 1, u_] := sqHorner[st[\"taubar\"][[1]], u];\nsqTau[st_, 2, u_] := sqG2[u] sqHorner[st[\"taubar\"][[2]], u];\nsqTau[st_, 3, u_] := sqG3[u] sqHorner[st[\"taubar\"][[3]], u];\nsqTau[st_, 4, u_] := (Times @@ sqZ) (Times @@ MapThread[If[#1 == \"A\", (u - #2 + sqH) (u - #2 - sqH) (u - #2 - 2 sqH) (u - #2 - 3 sqH), (u - #2) (u - #2 - sqH) (u - #2 - 2 sqH) (u - #2 - 4 sqH)] &, {sqTypes, sqTh}]);\nsqVvac[1][u_] := (u - sqTh[[1]] + sqH) (u - sqTh[[3]] + sqH) (u - sqTh[[2]]) (u - sqTh[[4]]);\nsqVvac[2][u_] := (u - sqTh[[1]]) (u - sqTh[[3]]) (u - sqTh[[2]]) (u - sqTh[[4]]);\nsqVvac[3][u_] := sqVvac[2][u];\nsqVvac[4][u_] := (u - sqTh[[1]]) (u - sqTh[[3]]) (u - sqTh[[2]] - sqH) (u - sqTh[[4]] - sqH);\nsqV4[u_] := sqVvac[4][u];\nsqYv[i_, u_] := sqZ[[i]] sqVvac[i][u];\nsqEa[a_, u_] := Sum[Product[sqYv[ss[[k]], u - (k - 1) sqH], {k, a}], {ss, Subsets[Range[4], {a}]}];\nsqVacIdx = Position[sqStates[[All, \"weight\"]], {2, 0, 0, -2}, {1}][[1, 1]];\nsqFull[st_] := Normal[SparseArray[Thread[st[\"blk\"] -> st[\"vec\"]], 256]];\nsqKetC[st_] := sqR . sqFull[st];\nsqVacOv = Table[Abs[sqVac . sqKetC[st]]/Norm[sqKetC[st]], {st, sqStates}];\nsqCombEv = sqStates[[All, \"comb\"]];\nGrid[{{\"# weight blocks / # states\", {Length[sqBlocks], Length[sqStates]}},\n  {\"max eigen-residual\", Max[sqStates[[All, \"res\"]]]},\n  {\"min gap of the combination spectrum (simple joint spectrum)\", Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[sqCombEv, {2}]]]},\n  {\"vacuum: max_a |τ_a − e_a(z_iV_i)| at u = 0.3141 (rel)\", Max[Table[Abs[sqTau[sqStates[[sqVacIdx]], a, 3141/10000]/sqEa[a, 3141/10000] - 1], {a, 4}]]},\n  {\"min / max |⟨0|Ψ⟩|/‖Ψ‖ over the 256 states\", {Min[sqVacOv], Max[sqVacOv]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"251\" data-out-n=\"277\" data-sub-idx=\"25\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"38\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[277]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># weight blocks / # states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max eigen-residual</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min gap of the combination spectrum (simple joint spectrum)</span></span></span></span><span s