=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.55851801</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sqx</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.025</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sqx</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.36em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.22em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.36em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.12em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.32em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.52em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.72em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.86em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.36em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[288]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{max Baxter residual (scaled), all 1024 solutions} & 0.\\times 10^{-52}\\\\\\hline\\text{min residual one degree lower (sample)} & 0.00358670815279180074612920259943725202523783734962136\\\\\\hline\\text{deg q\\_I = 2 + $\\Sigma$\\_\\{i$\\in$I\\} $\\mu$\\_i for all states, |I| $\\le$ 3} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{max Casoratian remainder after dividing by F\\_\\{|I|\\}} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{q₁₂₃₄ (state independent?)} & \\left\\{\\frac{1235}{169344},0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum q₁, q₂, q₃, q₄} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{sqx}^4-5.0687562\\,\\mathrm{sqx}^3+11.205241\\,\\mathrm{sqx}^2+17.773083\\,\\mathrm{sqx}+10.097251,\\mathrm{sqx}^2+1.1328947\\,\\mathrm{sqx}+0.55851801,\\mathrm{sqx}^2-4.025\\,\\mathrm{sqx}+14.4,1.\\,\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "2074b94e-377c-48ce-ab22-edf2db5b317e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [50d].** All 1024 single-index solutions exist at degree **deg q_i = 2 + μ_i** (scaled smallest singular value ≤ 7.7·10⁻⁴⁷; none at lower degree — the python scan starts at degree 0). Casoratian remainders ≤ 1.1·10⁻⁴³; **deg q_I = 2 + Σ_{i∈I}μ_i** (|I| ≤ 3); q₁₂₃₄ = 0.0072928476946334089191 for every state (quantum Wronskian). Vacuum (μ = (2,0,0,−2)): q₄ = 1, q₃₄ = 0.0952…, q₂₃₄ = 0.0377… (constants), q₁, q₂, q₃ of degrees 4, 2, 2. So the natural nesting of this vacuum is 4 → 34 → 234 (magnon numbers K₁ = deg q₄ = 2+μ₄, K₂ = deg q₃₄ = 2+μ₃+μ₄, K₃ = deg q₂₃₄ = 2−μ₁). For highest-weight states (dominant μ, the untwisted states of `abjm-Qfunctions.wb`) the lowest-degree Baxter solution is the one with twist z₄: the project's 'Q₁' is Q₄ here and its 'Q₁₂₃' is Q₂₃₄ (for a generic twisted eigenstate the lowest degree is attached to the smallest μ_i, so 'lowest degree' is not a good label; label by z_i).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. The dictionary\n\nRegularised Γ-gauge values at site s (the word-independent factor z_i^{θ_s/h}Φ(θ_s − 5h) is dropped; it cancels in all ratios):\n\nQ̃_i(θ_s − jh) = z_i^{−j} ∏_{b=j}^{4} V₄(θ_s − bh) · q_i(θ_s − jh).\n\nClaims tested over all 256 states:\n- **F site** (words t₁(θ_F)^k): τ₁(θ_F) = Q_j(θ_F)/Q_j(θ_F − h) for **every** j = 1..4 (at u = θ_F the Baxter equation collapses to two terms since t_{a≥2}(θ_F) = 0).\n- **A site** (words t_a(θ_A − h)): τ_a(θ_A − h) = D_a/D₀, D_a = det_{i∈I; j∈{1,2,3,4}∖{a+1}} Q_i(θ_A − jh), for **every** triple I (D₀ = Q_I(θ_A − 2h), D₃ = Q_I(θ_A − h) are Casoratians; D₁, D₂ are 'gapped' Casoratians).\n- **RV product form** (RV2 (5.20), `notes/rv-sov-dictionary.md` §2): ⟨Λ|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩ = ∏_s∏_{k≤3} det_{i,j≤k} Q^RV_{σ(i)}(x^s_{kj}) / (same at Λ = 0), Q^RV(u) = Q(u−h), for several σ.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sqQt[n_, i_, ths_, j_] := sqZ[[i]]^(-j) Product[sqV4[ths - b sqH], {b, j, 4}] (sqQs[[n]][\"Q\"][{i}] /. sqx -> ths - j sqH);\nsqDet3[n_, ss_, ths_, js_] := Det[Table[sqQt[n, i, ths, j], {i, ss}, {j, js}]];\nsqErrF = Max[Table[Abs[(sqQt[n, j, sqTh[[s]], 0]/sqQt[n, j, sqTh[[s]], 1])/sqTau[sqStates[[n]], 1, sqTh[[s]]] - 1], {n, 256}, {j, 4}, {s, {2, 4}}]];\nsqErrA = Max[Table[Abs[sqDet3[n, ss, sqTh[[s]], DeleteCases[Range[4], a + 1]]/sqDet3[n, ss, sqTh[[s]], {2, 3, 4}]/sqTau[sqStates[[n]], a, sqTh[[s]] - sqH] - 1], {n, 256}, {ss, Subsets[Range[4], {3}]}, {s, {1, 3}}, {a, 3}]];\n(* RV separated variables per level k = 1,2,3, in units j of the argument th - j h of Q (= Q^RV at th + (1-j) h) *)\nsqRVpts[\"F\", k_] := (1 - {{#[[1]]}, {#[[2]], -1}, {#[[3]], -1, -2}}) &[Join[ConstantArray[1, k], ConstantArray[0, 3 - k]]];\nsqRVpts[\"A\", a_] := 1 - {{0}, {0, -1}, DeleteCases[{0, -1, -2, -3}, -a]};\nsqRVsite[n_, s_, lab_, sig_] := Product[Det[Table[sqQt[n, sig[[i]], sqTh[[s]], jj], {i, k}, {jj, sqRVpts[sqTypes[[s]], lab][[k]]}]], {k, 3}];\nsqTauSite[n_] := {Table[sqTau[sqStates[[n]], a, sqTh[[1]] - sqH], {a, 0, 3}], Table[sqTau[sqStates[[n]], 1, sqTh[[2]]]^k, {k, 0, 3}],\n   Table[sqTau[sqStates[[n]], a, sqTh[[3]] - sqH], {a, 0, 3}], Table[sqTau[sqStates[[n]], 1, sqTh[[4]]]^k, {k, 0, 3}]};\nsqErrRV = Max[Table[Module[{site = Table[sqRVsite[n, s, lab, sig], {s, 4}, {lab, 0, 3}], ts = sqTauSite[n]},\n     Max[Table[Abs[Product[(site[[s, w[[s]] + 1]]/site[[s, 1]])/ts[[s, w[[s]] + 1]], {s, 4}] - 1], {w, sqWordsIdx}]]],\n    {n, 256}, {sig, {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 3, 2}, {2, 4, 1}, {3, 1, 4}}}]];\n(* polynomial gauge: <x|Psi>/<0|Psi> = N_x * (pure z^{u/h} q ratios), N_x exact *)\nsqNsite[s_, lab_] := If[sqTypes[[s]] == \"F\", sqV4[sqTh[[s]]]^lab, Product[sqV4[sqTh[[s]] - b sqH], {b, 1, lab}]];\nGrid[{{\"F site: max |τ₁(θ_F)·Q_j(θ_F−h)/Q_j(θ_F) − 1|, all j, all states\", sqErrF},\n  {\"A site: max |τ_a(θ_A−h)·D₀/D_a − 1|, all triples I, a = 1,2,3, all states\", sqErrA},\n  {\"RV product formula, 256 words × 256 states × 4 σ\", sqErrRV},\n  {\"polynomial-gauge N_x per site (label 0..3): sites 1, 2, 3, 4\", Table[sqNsite[s, lab], {s, 4}, {lab, 0, 3}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"253\" data-out-n=\"299\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[299]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.4604em;vertical-align:-3.9602em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5002em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.4602em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4602em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4204em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9602em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4602em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.2804em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6602em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F site: max |</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">₁(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">_F)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Q_j(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-righ