span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[307]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{word} & \\text{B-eigenbra (exact)} & \\text{$\\beta$\\_w/$\\beta$₀ = prediction (exact, u = 37/100)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,0,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,0,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,0,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,1,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,3,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,0,1,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,0,2,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,0,3,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,0,0,1\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,0,0,2\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,0,0,3\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,3,2\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "19d0654a-1789-4eb2-8cf0-420b6c0a22a5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [f64].** All 256 words are B-eigen (residual 1.3·10⁻¹⁰), and β_w(u)/β₀(u) = ∏_A(u−θ_A)/(u−θ_A+a_A h)·∏_F((u−θ_F−h)/(u−θ_F))^{k_F} for all 256 words at 41 points (max deviation 1.2·10⁻⁹). Separated variables: **F site** x ∈ {θ_F, θ_F+h}³ with k of them at θ_F + h (vacuum: all at θ_F); **A site** {θ_A, θ_A−h, θ_A−2h, θ_A−3h} ∖ {θ_A − ah} (vacuum: θ_A−h, θ_A−2h, θ_A−3h) — exactly RV2's GT variables with θ^RV_F = θ_F, θ^RV_A = θ_A − h (`notes/rv-sov-dictionary.md` §2). In the RV argument Q^RV(u) = Q(u−h) the wave functions are Q^RV evaluated at these x.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Ket SoV basis, dual basis, Gram matrix and measure\n\nThe dual basis |y_x⟩ (⟨x|y_{x'}⟩ = δ) is not itself made of single transfer-matrix words. A natural *ket* SoV basis was found by scanning ket vacua and ket words (f64 scan: two product vacua × 6 A-site × 7 F-site word types): **|0̄⟩ = e₄⊗e₁⊗e₄⊗e₁** (A: e₄, F: e₁) and\n\n|m₁,n₂,m₃,n₄⟩ = t₁(θ₁)^{m₁} t_{n₂}(θ₂ + n₂h) t₁(θ₃)^{m₃} t_{n₄}(θ₄ + n₄h) |0̄⟩\n\n(A sites: powers of t₁ at θ_A; F sites: t_n at θ_F + nh = 'starred' t*_n(θ_F+h), columns ascending). It is the only candidate with a sparse Gram matrix (1456 of 65536 nonzero; next best 8728, all others dense or rank-deficient).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sqKetVac = sqProd4[UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1]];\nsqKet[lab_] := Module[{v = sqKetVac},\n   Do[If[sqTypes[[s]] == \"A\", Do[v = sqTc[1, sqTh[[s]]] . v, {lab[[s]]}],\n      If[lab[[s]] > 0, v = sqTc[lab[[s]], sqTh[[s]] + lab[[s]] sqH] . v]], {s, 4, 1, -1}]; Normal[v]];\nsqY = Transpose[sqKet /@ sqWordsIdx];\nsqGram = sqW . sqY;\nsqNZ = Position[sqGram, _?(# != 0 &), {2}, Heads -> False];\nsqBar[j_] := sqWordIndex[3 - sqWordsIdx[[j]]];\nsqEdges = Cases[sqNZ, {i_, j_} /; i != sqBar[j] :> DirectedEdge[i, sqBar[j]]];\nsqMeasure = Association[Flatten[Table[Module[{xs = Flatten[Position[Total /@ sqWordsIdx, S]], ys, Bi},\n      ys = sqBar /@ xs; Bi = Inverse[sqGram[[xs, ys]]];\n      Table[If[Bi[[i, j]] =!= 0, {ys[[i]], xs[[j]]} -> Bi[[i, j]], Nothing], {i, Length[xs]}, {j, Length[xs]}]], {S, 0, 12}]]];\nsqPerDual = Counts[Keys[sqMeasure][[All, 2]]];\nGrid[{{\"rank of the 256 ket words (exact)\", MatrixRank[sqY]},\n  {\"# nonzero ⟨x|y⟩\", Length[sqNZ]},\n  {\"charge rule: ⟨x|y⟩ ≠ 0 ⇒ Σx + Σy = 12\", And @@ (Total[sqWordsIdx[[#[[1]]]]] + Total[sqWordsIdx[[#[[2]]]]] == 12 & /@ sqNZ)},\n  {\"⟨x|3−x⟩ ≠ 0 for all x\", And @@ Table[sqGram[[j, sqBar[j]]] =!= 0, {j, 256}]},\n  {\"triangular (off-diagonal graph x → 3−y acyclic)\", AcyclicGraphQ[Graph[Range[256], sqEdges]]},\n  {\"# nonzero entries of the measure M = G⁻¹\", Length[sqMeasure]},\n  {\"# dual vectors |y_x⟩ that are a single ket word\", Count[Values[sqPerDual], 1]},\n  {\"max # ket words in one dual vector\", Max[Values[sqPerDual]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"255\" data-out-n=\"317\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"23\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[317]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of the 256 ket words (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># nonzero ⟨x|y⟩</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">charge rule: ⟨x|y⟩ </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span>