pan><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">26</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[317]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rank of the 256 ket words (exact)} & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nonzero ⟨x|y⟩} & 1456\\\\\\hline\\text{charge rule: ⟨x|y⟩ $\\not=$ 0 $\\Rightarrow$ $\\Sigma$x + $\\Sigma$y = 12} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{⟨x|3−x⟩ $\\not=$ 0 for all x} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{triangular (off-diagonal graph x -> 3−y acyclic)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nonzero entries of the measure M = G⁻¹} & 1456\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# dual vectors |y\\_x⟩ that are a single ket word} & 48\\\\\\hline\\text{max \\# ket words in one dual vector} & 26\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4e8402af-c599-4ca7-be00-91310e1b916a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [exact].** Ket words rank 256. ⟨x|y⟩ has **1456 nonzeros**; ⟨x|y⟩ ≠ 0 only if **S_x + S_y = 12** (S = total SoV charge Σ labels) and always ⟨x|ȳ = 3−x⟩ ≠ 0; with ȳ-relabelling G is **triangular** (acyclic off-diagonal pattern), block sizes by charge 1, 4, 10, 20, 31, 40, 44, 40, 31, 20, 10, 4, 1. Hence **no diagonal SoV measure μ(x) in this (or any word-type) ket basis**: the measure M = G⁻¹ (exact rationals, same sparsity 1456) is triangular, as GLMRV found for sl(3) ('block-triangular in the SoV charge'). Per-site selection rules of the pattern (x_s, ȳ_s): A site x ∈ {0,3} → ȳ = x, x ∈ {1,2} → any ȳ; F site x = 0 → ȳ ∈ {0,1,2}, x = 3 → ȳ ∈ {1,2,3}, x ∈ {1,2} → ȳ ∈ {1,2}; the pattern does not factorise over pairs (1798 vs 1456). 48 of the 256 dual vectors are single ket words (e.g. |y_{0000}⟩ ∝ t₁(θ₁)³t₃(θ₂+3h)t₁(θ₃)³t₃(θ₄+3h)|0̄⟩, |y_{3333}⟩ ∝ |0̄⟩), the others are combinations of 2–26 ket words. The diagonal entries ⟨x|3−x⟩ do not factorise over sites. Completeness 1 = Σ_{x,y}|y⟩M_{yx}⟨x| verified on eigenstates (§10). (The ket words are not eigenvectors of B or of the *-image of B; a GLMR C-operator was not identified.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Dual (ket) wave functions\n\nDual Q's w_I(u) = Z_I^{(u−θ_s)/h} q_I(u), Z_I = ∏_{i∈I} z_i (triple-index Q's, i.e. Hodge duals Q^l). Tests: A site τ₁(θ_A) = N_A w_I(θ_A−2h)/w_I(θ_A−h) (any I); F site (Cramer solution of the dual Baxter equation at u = θ_F, where τ₄(θ_F+4h) = 0): τ_n(θ_F+nh) = N_{F,n} det[w_I(θ_F+(j−1)h)]_{j∈{0..3}∖{n}} / det[…]_{j=1,2,3} (any three triples).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sqWI[n_, ss_, u_, ths_] := (Times @@ sqZ[[ss]])^((u - ths)/sqH) (sqQs[[n]][\"Q\"][ss] /. sqx -> u);\nsqTriples = Subsets[Range[4], {3}];\nsqSpread[l_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[l]/First[Flatten[l]] - 1]];\nsqNA = Table[Table[sqTau[sqStates[[n]], 1, sqTh[[s]]] sqWI[n, ss, sqTh[[s]] - sqH, sqTh[[s]]]/sqWI[n, ss, sqTh[[s]] - 2 sqH, sqTh[[s]]], {n, 256}, {ss, sqTriples}], {s, {1, 3}}];\nsqNF = Table[Table[Module[{mm = Table[sqWI[n, ss, sqTh[[s]] + (j - 1) sqH, sqTh[[s]]], {ss, sqTriples[[1 ;; 3]]}, {j, 0, 3}]},\n      sqTau[sqStates[[n]], a, sqTh[[s]] + a sqH] Det[mm[[All, {2, 3, 4}]]]/Det[mm[[All, DeleteCases[{1, 2, 3, 4}, a + 1]]]]], {n, 256}], {s, {2, 4}}, {a, 3}];\nGrid[{{\"A sites 1, 3: N_A and its spread over states and triples\", Table[{sqNA[[k, 1, 1]], sqSpread[sqNA[[k]]]}, {k, 2}]},\n  {\"F sites 2, 4: N_{F,n}, n = 1,2,3, and spreads\", Table[{sqNF[[k, a, 1]], sqSpread[sqNF[[k, a]]]}, {k, 2}, {a, 3}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"256\" data-out-n=\"323\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"26\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[323]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.86em;vertical-align:-2.16em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.66em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.82em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.16em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.66em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.67em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.46em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A sites 1, 3: N_A and its spread over states and triples</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.46em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F sites 2, 4: N_{F,n}, n = 1,2,3, and spreads</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.16em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycols