>48</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.96em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.16em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.82em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.16em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.66em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.66em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.32em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.66em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.16em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[323]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{A sites 1, 3: N\\_A and its spread over states and triples} & \\begin{pmatrix}0.030700986331452803756010753095301200257468479042823066 & 0.\\times 10^{-47}\\\\0.93829300127263527499655008509790091844401171437771202 & 0.\\times 10^{-47}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{F sites 2, 4: N\\_\\{F,n\\}, n = 1,2,3, and spreads} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-0.01703153988868274582560296846011131725417439703154,0.\\times 10^{-46}\\right\\} & \\left\\{-0.002291160793884090995143208236237655797687602617367,0.\\times 10^{-47}\\right\\} & \\left\\{-0.004186352467448538601742673049050212835274844561609,0.\\times 10^{-46}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-0.07152822066326530612244897959183673469387755102041,0.\\times 10^{-48}\\right\\} & \\left\\{-0.001112703832717554061281284313354284199765249327932,0.\\times 10^{-48}\\right\\} & \\left\\{0.00002999205509214664702009230550239826001548660397517,0.\\times 10^{-48}\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "5c044289-a966-4fc3-b0ce-61b98b888f09"
