   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [50d].** A site: N_A = 0.030700986331452803756 (site 1), 0.938293001272635275 (site 3), spread over 256 states × 4 triples ≤ 2.5·10⁻⁴³. F site: N_{F,n} = −0.017031539888682745826, −0.0022911607938840909951, −0.0041863524674485386017 (site 2), −0.071528220663265306122, −0.0011127038327175540613, 0.00002999205509214664702 (site 4), spreads ≤ 1.6·10⁻⁴¹; with the wrong point offset (columns at θ_F + jh) the spreads are O(1–10³). So the ket basis is the **mirror** of the bra basis: **A sites carry powers of a single dual Q** (ratio Q^l(θ_A−2h)/Q^l(θ_A−h) in the Casoratian argument), **F sites a 3×3 Slater/Casoratian of three dual Q's** with one column omitted (points θ_F−h, θ_F, θ_F+h, θ_F+2h) — as conjectured in `notes/rv-sov-dictionary.md` §4 [I]. The N's are gauge constants (polynomial-gauge q's); a Γ-type gauge for the dual Q's would absorb them as N_x = 1 does on the bra side.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Completeness, the norm, and ⟨0|Ψ⟩\n\n⟨0|Ψ⟩ alone depends on the normalisation of |Ψ⟩ (RV fix it by ⟨Ω_σ|Ψ⟩ = 1, i.e. ⟨0|Ψ⟩ = the RV product at the vacuum variables, `rv-sov-dictionary.md` §6 — a convention). The normalisation-independent object is 𝒩(Ψ) = ⟨0|Ψ⟩⟨Ψᴸ|0̄⟩/⟨Ψᴸ|Ψ⟩ (⟨Ψᴸ| = left eigenvector). Completeness gives\n\n1/𝒩(Ψ) = Σ_{x,y} τ̃_y(Ψ) M_{yx} τ_x(Ψ),\n\nτ_x = ⟨x|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩ (bra dictionary, §6) and τ̃_y = ⟨Ψᴸ|y⟩/⟨Ψᴸ|0̄⟩ (dual dictionary, §9): a closed expression in Q-values at the inhomogeneities and the exact measure.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sqLeft = Association[Flatten[Table[Module[{ns = Flatten[Position[sqStates[[All, \"blk\"]], blk, {1}]], Lb},\n      Lb = Inverse[Transpose[sqStates[[ns, \"vec\"]]]];\n      Table[ns[[k]] -> Normal[SparseArray[Thread[blk -> Lb[[k]]], 256]], {k, Length[ns]}]], {blk, sqBlocks}]]];\nsqRinv = Inverse[sqR];\n(* bra and ket SoV wave functions from the Q's only *)\nsqBraQ[n_, w_] := Product[If[sqTypes[[s]] == \"F\", (sqQt[n, 1, sqTh[[s]], 0]/sqQt[n, 1, sqTh[[s]], 1])^w[[s]],\n     sqDet3[n, {1, 2, 3}, sqTh[[s]], DeleteCases[Range[4], w[[s]] + 1]]/sqDet3[n, {1, 2, 3}, sqTh[[s]], {2, 3, 4}]], {s, 4}];\nsqKetQ[n_, y_] := Product[If[sqTypes[[s]] == \"A\",\n     (sqNA[[(s + 1)/2, 1, 1]] sqWI[n, {1, 2, 3}, sqTh[[s]] - 2 sqH, sqTh[[s]]]/sqWI[n, {1, 2, 3}, sqTh[[s]] - sqH, sqTh[[s]]])^y[[s]],\n     If[y[[s]] == 0, 1, Module[{mm = Table[sqWI[n, ss, sqTh[[s]] + (j - 1) sqH, sqTh[[s]]], {ss, sqTriples[[1 ;; 3]]}, {j, 0, 3}]},\n       sqNF[[s/2, y[[s]], 1]] Det[mm[[All, DeleteCases[{1, 2, 3, 4}, y[[s]] + 1]]]]/Det[mm[[All, {2, 3, 4}]]]]]], {s, 4}];\n(* sample: the vacuum, the opposite extremal state (weight (-2,0,0,2)) and two states of the 28-dim zero-weight block *)\nsqSample = {sqVacIdx, Position[sqStates[[All, \"weight\"]], {-2, 0, 0, 2}, {1}][[1, 1]],\n   Sequence @@ Position[sqStates[[All, \"weight\"]], {0, 0, 0, 0}, {1}][[{1, 5}, 1]]};\nsqNormCheck = Table[Module[{k = sqKetC[sqStates[[n]]], b = sqLeft[n] . sqRinv, ov, ovL, nrm, tot, totQ},\n     ov = sqW . k; ovL = b . sqY; nrm = b . k;\n     tot = Total[KeyValueMap[ovL[[#1[[1]]]] #2 ov[[#1[[2]]]] &, sqMeasure]];\n     totQ = Total[KeyValueMap[sqKetQ[n, sqWordsIdx[[#1[[1]]]]] #2 sqBraQ[n, sqWordsIdx[[#1[[2]]]]] &, sqMeasure]];\n     {n, sqStates[[n, \"weight\"]], Abs[tot/nrm - 1], nrm/(ov[[1]] ovL[[1]]), Abs[totQ/(nrm/(ov[[1]] ovL[[1]])) - 1]}], {n, sqSample}];\nGrid[Prepend[sqNormCheck, {\"state\", \"weight\", \"|Σ⟨Ψᴸ|y⟩M⟨x|Ψ⟩/⟨Ψᴸ|Ψ⟩ − 1|\", \"1/𝒩 = ⟨Ψᴸ|Ψ⟩/(⟨0|Ψ⟩⟨Ψᴸ|0̄⟩)\", \"|Q-formula/direct − 1|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"257\" data-out-n=\"330\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"29\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[330]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">201</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">248</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.